{
  "version": "0.2",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "The facing field",
    "description": "The Cyclops' cave: every object faces away from where the blinded giant gropes, by an explicit orientation attribute that Copy to Points reads. The backward bow is the first instance; switch the attribute off and every copy keeps its glyph's own facing, as 93 bows once did."
